Number one, they will first need to ask whether or not

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.880
the national emergency required the use of the armed forces

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.240
and number two whether the building of a border wall is

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:24.920
necessary to support the use of the Armed Forces.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.160
They will also look at precedent.

