This construction authority has been used two other times by both Bush presidents.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:33.320
With George W. Bush, it was after the attacks of 9/11.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.720
And we sent troops all over the world and the construction authority

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.840
was necessary to support those troops as they went about the global war on terror.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:45.760
In addition, George H. W. Bush cited this authority when Kuwait was first invaded by Iraq.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:50.480
And we needed to intervene and create infrastructure for our militaries so that we could stop that from happening.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:55.480
Now the courts could very well rule in favor of the Trump administration here.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.800
That wouldn't surprise me at all.

